# FEATURES.md (iOS feature catalog)

When you add, change, or remove a **user-facing capability**, update `FEATURES.md` in the same change.

- Edit the relevant section so it matches what the app ships now.
- Add a short **New / Changed / Removed** line near the top (include plan gating if that changed).
- PR CI (`check-features-md`) fails if capability paths change without `FEATURES.md`.
- Not a capability change (refactor, copy, style, tests)? Do not pad the catalog. The PR can use label `skip-features-md` or `[skip-features]` in the title.
